<title>JAPAN: Ohkura Electric up on expected good sales.</title>
<headline>Ohkura Electric up on expected good sales.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-09-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares of Ohkura Electric Co Ltd were up on Friday afternoon, supported by expectations that sales of the firm's new transmission equipment to be supplied to Nippon Telegraph and Telephone Corp for its new, low-cost leased line services are likely to jump, traders said.</p>
<p>At 0514 GMT, the share price was up 45 yen at 954. Volume was 285,000 shares.</p>
</text>
